[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17050.51, "timestamp": "04:44:10", "text": "告诉我，如果我转发这条推文会发生什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17052.788, "timestamp": "04:44:12", "text": "就像出现在我的直播流里一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17058.31, "timestamp": "04:44:18", "text": "聊天内容就像……呃，jness刚刚转发了这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17062.59, "timestamp": "04:44:22", "text": "哦等等，它出现在Twitch聊天室里了，但是它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17066.83, "timestamp": "04:44:26", "text": "也没有出现在 YouTube 聊天记录中。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17071.43, "timestamp": "04:44:31", "text": "Leo 板的 YouTube 页面已发布"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17075.51, "timestamp": "04:44:35", "text": "是的，扩展程序已经发布了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17080.628, "timestamp": "04:44:40", "text": "所以，呃，我可能需要做一些改动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17086.628, "timestamp": "04:44:46", "text": "关于我如何再次直播之类的东西，嗯，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17089.19, "timestamp": "04:44:49", "text": "嗯，你管这叫什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17091.868, "timestamp": "04:44:51", "text": "嗯，我们来吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17095.75, "timestamp": "04:44:55", "text": "就像跟随，而不是你所谓的“我”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17097.51, "timestamp": "04:44:57", "text": "无法控制"}]